A quarter of you say you
run your own business,

00:06:01.329 --> 00:06:03.204
but only one person had to shut down.

00:06:03.954 --> 00:06:07.579
And now here's the data point where things
I think it really interesting,

00:06:08.038 --> 00:06:12.579
40 percent of you say that big social
issues have always been at

00:06:12.579 --> 00:06:14.871
the heart of who you are and what you do.

